      }
    ]
  ,
  "rationale": "Adding the pipelined family is essential because iterative and unrolled_k cannot meet the throughput and latency constraints. The ranges are focused on achieving the required accuracy (max_abs_err <= 2^-12) while minimizing area, as pipelined designs tend to have higher area due to registers."
